Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi\NJimmyVictus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NGol D. Rocks\NPepperjack\NScolines\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko\NPhosCity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Villager
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}CraigyBoi\NKustogg\NPollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets, every tear that we pride\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NghostDunk\NPamkinPinguin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.11,0:01:56.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(979,478)\t(938,979,\1a&H00&)\t(5442,5484,\1a&HFF&)}Godkiller
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.11,0:01:56.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(979,478)}Godkiller
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, he's not holding back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything here is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where those detestable Shandora\Nwarriors have hidden their village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're originally from the blue sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely they would love to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, fall to the world below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our village! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could have been us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had waited any\Nlonger, we'd be ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of Great Warrior Kal 'gara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, Great Warrior Kal 'gara,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your distant ancestor had many reasons\Nfor wanting to take back our homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but one you may not know he\Nhad another reason yes it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would become his greatest\Nregret now listen great warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara had a very close friend
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara had a friend that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right he came to know Kalgara
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,400 years ago his name Mont
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:04:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The following tale took place long,\Nlong ago, some 400 years in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though it was never written down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it has remained in people's hearts\Nfrom one generation to the next.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.37,0:04:11.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\fad(480,232)}Jaya, the Grand Line\N400 Years Ago
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.37,0:04:11.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\3c&H252321&\fad(480,232)\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(5068,5110,\1a&HFF&)}Jaya, the Grand Line\N400 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to the ship, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster of Century is right\Nbehind us! Hurry! Cast off! Cast off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Captain, there's still crewmen–
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get us out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll face my wrath!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.21,0:05:04.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,125)\fad(480,0)}Kalgara\NThe Great Warrior of Shandora
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.21,0:05:04.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H171615&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,125)\3c&H171615&\fad(480,0)\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)}Kalgara\NThe Great Warrior of Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave your possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flee with your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, the Daily Report.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.02,0:05:18.57,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\fad(479,482)}{Somewhere on the Grand Line... - OG}Elsewhere on the Grand Line...{PJ}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.02,0:05:18.57,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\3c&H252321&\fad(479,482)\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(6068,6109,\1a&HFF&)}{Somewhere on the Grand Line... - OG}Elsewhere on the Grand Line...{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to inform you that we've\Nreached the end of our food supply,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning, of course, we are now\Nlost at sea and will slowly die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cook fainted. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Commodore\Nfell into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he decide to drown himself\Nand leave us to our fates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he decided on a quick\Ndeath over starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Commodore is a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already returned\Ntwice from these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what are these carefully\Nfolded clothes and shoes here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone go check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sea is chock full of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a crafty one. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's the rope for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haul it in, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, did you kill\Nthat beast underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cook it up for us.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.50,0:06:17.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,495)\fad(476,0)}Commodore Mont Blanc Noland\NExploration Ship\NKingdom of Lvneel, North Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.50,0:06:17.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,495)\3c&H252321&\fad(476,0)\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Commodore Mont Blanc Noland\NExploration Ship\NKingdom of Lvneel, North Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been getting lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.11,0:06:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, must be losing my touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This storm's a real Wapol, Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've been through worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The yardarm's been broken off. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made, made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This third voyage has kept\Nus at sea for over two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a miracle we've lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did anybody else hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear what you mean the thunder no it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something else something\Nbeautiful like a bell
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.70,0:07:01.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,125)\fad(1481,0)}{May 21, 1222\NThe Age of Kaien\NJaya, the Grand Line - OG}Jaya, the Grand Line\NMay 21, 1222 of\Nthe Pelagic Calendar{PJ}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.70,0:07:01.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,125)\3c&H171615&\fad(1481,0)\t(1439,1481,\1a&H00&)}{May 21, 1222\NThe Age of Kaien\NJaya, the Grand Line - OG}Jaya, the Grand Line\NMay 21, 1222 of\Nthe Pelagic Calendar{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priest are you certain of\Nthis this land is cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Shandians\Nwill be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what can we do to\Nsave the village priest we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must offer another girl\Nat the sacrificial altar
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much death. How many now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well over a hundred how can this be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing like this has ever happened to us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If i can help save the village then\Ni will gladly sacrifice my life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you cry, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is truly an honor to be chosen as\Nsacrifice and embraced by the sun god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is a proud and happy day for\Nme, and it should be for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for raising\Nme right these many years, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is a bad dream, let me wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.95,0:08:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to grow up to\Nbe just like you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a brave warrior\Nand fight to protect this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die from\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took the heading you said to,\Nand sure enough, there's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, how fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can ride out the storm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you sure none of you guys heard it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope. None of us heard any\Nbells. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you must have been\Nhearing things, Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we find stuff to help our research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop, drop, drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Commodore, there's your bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, enough, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd mistake\Nthat freak bird call for a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Commodore, did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has such a beautiful tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems there are people here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Commodore, slow down. Wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's collapsed over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a plague called tree fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of him,\Nhe hasn't been treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, check our Cannon stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Administer doses to this young\Nman and the crew immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the crops are being eaten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, the whole village is infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring the girl to the altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of the rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of the forest, God of the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in exchange for this girl's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we beseech you, spare our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the God Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the village, let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Kashi god, such a divine former!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please save my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please save my son and spare my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something fell in? Fell in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened? Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kashi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's killed a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ceremony is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be killed both!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offer the gods more lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we incur their wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Commodore's gone\Nand done it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sound really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guy just can't keep to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.87,0:13:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tribal rituals ain't something\Nyou mess around with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the gods ain't a\Ngreat warrior, Kalgara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am an explorer from the North\NBlue, Commodore Montblanc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are, outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.93,0:13:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just destroy old manor of progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to impose your values.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's holding his own against Kalgara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, use that blade to\Ngive your life to the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sacrifice meant to save the entire\Nvillage, weeping because she wants to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgraceful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our people have strictly\Nupheld the sacred commandment
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that all intruders on this\Nisland must be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have committed the\Nunforgivable sin of slaughtering Kashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alone cannot atone for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and all your men\Nwill pay with your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sacrifices this, lives\Nthat! It's insane how does!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That make your gods happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ceremonies are flat-out denials of\Nthe triumphs of all great men before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insult every adventurer\Nand researcher who's ever
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,set out to see in hopes of\Nbringing prosperity to mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How shameful if your\Ngods value your lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't they have contempt\Nfor these very ceremonies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me some time, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your so-called curse, I\Nwill lift it for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I cannot, you may do what\Nyou will with my crew and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in return, if I do save this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from tragedy you must\Nswear never to perform
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this ceremony again is\Nthat all you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:16:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say ridiculous now\Nprepare to die let him try
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you say chief\Nno you will have until
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sundown tomorrow when your crew will die
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept your terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fellas, come sunset tomorrow,\Nlooks like it's goodbye world for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have faith in the Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pretty lady, I feel bad for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame you were born here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with your looks, you could have married\Nan aristocrat and lived the good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn a little tact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the Commodore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Montblanc Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a rather famous explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also a skilled botanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He explores uncharted islands and documents\Nnew species of plants for his research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty much a hero in our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's way too nice a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's impossible for him\Nto ignore a situation like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we can trust him, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you not let Kalgara\Nkill him right then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer will make\Nitself known tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he can save our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no harm in waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll listen to him, but\Nnot the shaman's dying words?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara, please say\Nsomething about this outrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I sense that the village is\Nin even the slightest danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not hesitate to take that\Nman's head before sunset tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not have the power to\Nhear the words of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I can hear the words\Nof a man who speaks in earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.95,0:17:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great warrior Kal 'gara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he mean by progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Conney tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there had to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a forest this huge?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:18.72,0:18:24.73,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,650)\fad(481,732)}Dawn
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.72,0:18:24.73,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H171615&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,650)\3c&H171615&\fad(481,732)\t(440,481,\1a&H00&)\t(5278,5320,\1a&HFF&)}Dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kashi's wrath has finally come!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us out of here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such devastation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest floor has sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks as if the island\Nis tearing itself apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking well. I\Nsuppose the gods have
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken your punishment into\Ntheir own divine hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then your gods have grown weak they lack
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the strength to kill\Neven one lowly explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stubborn fool. Sorry, but would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving I don't feel like looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry to the village how amusing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll enjoy watching this\Ngo ahead and squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another warrior has died there\Nis that terrible earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the evil spirits!\NNow we will punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wasn't the agreement.\NLook out! Stop! Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seto muicide what's the meaning of\Nthis this is pathetic the Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warriors I know and look up to they\Nshow a lot more pride than you do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kid it won't be long now you should
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prepare yourself for when the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sets that's when the lives of your\Nmen will be an offering unto the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, the Earth certainly did\Nswallow you up skillfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was truly an act of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're still alive\Nis what's hardest to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.57,0:21:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring every sacrifice to the altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Commodore will be\Nback in a few more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us more time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sun is setting. The\Nceremony must be starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disgusting is this the wreck\Nof a man who defied the gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.89,0:21:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid you fear what you\Ndo not know and you trade
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,innocent people's lives\Nfor false consolations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:21:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sacrifices are pointless deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.61,0:22:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have lived this way for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.53,0:22:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.45,0:22:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lives of your citizens\Nare more precious than gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the sacrifices to the altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.63,0:22:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn them at the stake and\Nsend them to the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.85,0:22:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, don't let them burn us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can send an innocent\Ngirl to her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.07,0:22:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And have no remorse, so\NI doubt you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.55,0:22:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're doing is less than human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No remorse, you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The innocent girl you speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.69,0:23:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would tell your own\Ndaughter to give up her life?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very wrong, and\Nyou don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand. There is so much power in the words\Nof our gods, and the people must obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gods will not hear our pleas, even\Nif we ask them to spare our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.77,0:23:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.79,0:23:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be one of Kashi's children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The god's blood has come\Nto pass judgment on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.91,0:23:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judgment, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:24:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain. Tree fever is a plague.\NA plague that wiped out hundreds
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of thousands of lives In my own village\Nyears ago and now it is ravaging
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.49,0:24:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yours but it's gone no one's died\Nin decades as a Result of this awful
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disease no one and do you know why
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we discovered a cure for it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding in my hand\Nbark from the Conney tree
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the cure I only need to\Nextract the Conney from it If I
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.01,0:24:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can bring this back to your people\NI can save all of their lives
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.05,0:24:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you insist on keeping countless\Nmasses from their cure Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,realize how many innocent victims\Nhave already perished because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I stand by what I said Your\Nceremonies are an insult to my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.95,0:24:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too busy blindly\Ntrampling over great
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.83,0:24:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,advancements to see how\Nmuch it could benefit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may die in judgment, or\NI may die in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'll stay true to my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.27,0:25:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will your village die?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.81,0:25:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.79,0:25:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the pain you cause your people\Nworth it to be true to your gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the words of a\Nman who speaks in earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.37,0:25:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.95,0:25:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.87,0:25:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.37,0:25:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.47,0:25:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just broke one of our commandments.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.09,0:25:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just killed a precious god.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.63,0:25:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A god!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.35,0:25:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.39,0:25:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all you can see is a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.03,0:25:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you see our deadly curse\Nas some curable disease!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, can you save our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.31,0:25:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.91,0:26:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.43,0:27:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're lost and alone,\NI can always hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.65,0:27:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you wander far from\Nhome, gazing up at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are just like the moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.35,0:27:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you never change as you\Nclimb into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.49,0:27:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you disappear, fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.95,0:27:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.45,0:27:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.59,0:27:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.97,0:28:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're windless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.31,0:28:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.63,0:28:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.35,0:28:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.03,0:28:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.91,0:28:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.95,0:28:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.47,0:28:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just keep moving on.

